        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Rudd, Mark Evans\n- Bands: AC/DC, Cheetah, Buster Brown\n- Albums: Cheetah third LP\n- Places: Australia, Europe\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, Cheetah's third LP was released in Australia and Europe.\n- Mark Evans played bass guitar on Cheetah's third LP.\n- Phil Rudd was in the Australian band Buster Brown.\n- Phil Rudd became the only Australian-born member of AC/DC when Mark Evans left the band.",
